## 7. 错误处理流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Request[接收请求] --> ValidateInput{输入验证}
    ValidateInput -->|无效| BadRequest[400 Bad Request<br/>INVALID_JSON/MISSING_FIELDS]
    ValidateInput -->|有效| ProcessRequest[处理请求]
    
    ProcessRequest --> BusinessLogic{业务逻辑执行}
    BusinessLogic -->|用户不存在| NotFound[404 Not Found<br/>USER_NOT_FOUND]
    BusinessLogic -->|权限不足| Forbidden[403 Forbidden<br/>PERMISSION_DENIED]
    BusinessLogic -->|业务验证失败| ValidationError[400 Bad Request<br/>VALIDATION_ERROR]
    BusinessLogic -->|成功| Success[200 OK<br/>返回成功数据]
    
    ProcessRequest --> DatabaseOperation{数据库操作}
    DatabaseOperation -->|连接失败| DBError[500 Internal Error<br/>DATABASE_CONNECTION_ERROR]
    DatabaseOperation -->|超时| Timeout[500 Internal Error<br/>DATABASE_TIMEOUT]
    DatabaseOperation -->|约束冲突| Conflict[409 Conflict<br/>USERNAME_EXISTS/EMAIL_EXISTS]
    DatabaseOperation -->|成功| Success
    
    ProcessRequest --> CacheOperation{缓存操作}
    CacheOperation -->|Redis连接失败| CacheError[记录警告,继续处理]
    CacheOperation -->|缓存超时| CacheTimeout[记录警告,继续处理]
    CacheOperation -->|成功| Success
    
    ProcessRequest --> ExternalCall{外部服务调用}
    ExternalCall -->|API网关不可用| ServiceUnavailable[503 Service Unavailable<br/>GATEWAY_UNAVAILABLE]
    ExternalCall -->|调用超时| ExternalTimeout[500 Internal Error<br/>EXTERNAL_SERVICE_TIMEOUT]
    ExternalCall -->|成功| Success
    
    ProcessRequest --> UnexpectedError{未预期错误}
    UnexpectedError --> LogError[记录错误日志]
    LogError --> InternalError[500 Internal Error<br/>INTERNAL_ERROR]
    
    %% 错误恢复
    CacheError --> ProcessRequest
    CacheTimeout --> ProcessRequest
    
    %% 错误响应格式化
    BadRequest --> FormatError[格式化错误响应]
    NotFound --> FormatError
    Forbidden --> FormatError
    ValidationError --> FormatError
    DBError --> FormatError
    Timeout --> FormatError
    Conflict --> FormatError
    ServiceUnavailable --> FormatError
    ExternalTimeout --> FormatError
    InternalError --> FormatError
    
    FormatError --> ErrorResponse["错误响应<br/>{error: true, error_code: CODE, <br/>error_message: 描述, timestamp: time}"]
    
    Success --> SuccessResponse["成功响应<br/>{success: true, data: {...}, <br/>timestamp: time}"]
    
    ErrorResponse --> Client[返回给客户端]
    SuccessResponse --> Client
    
    %% 样式
    classDef processClass fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef errorClass fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    classDef successClass fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0277bd,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warningClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:2px
    
    class Request,ProcessRequest,FormatError processClass
    class BadRequest,NotFound,Forbidden,ValidationError,DBError,Timeout,Conflict,ServiceUnavailable,ExternalTimeout,InternalError,ErrorResponse errorClass
    class Success,SuccessResponse successClass
    class CacheError,CacheTimeout warningClass
```
